{"id":"wb-6-626","name":"尉氏兴国寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"尉氏兴国寺塔","text":"尉氏兴国寺塔，位于中华人民共和国河南省开封市尉氏县，因其原位于县城大东门外半公里兴国寺内，俗名东关塔。该塔于1963年被列为河南省文物保护单位，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%89%E6%B0%8F%E5%85%B4%E5%9B%BD%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94549585,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94549585","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7d5fe08919e75e31a0e137fc.jpg","title":"20260830_Xingguo_Temple_Pagoda,_Weishi_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260830_Xingguo_Temple_Pagoda,_Weishi_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/20260830_Xingguo_Temple_Pagoda%2C_Weishi_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南尉氏 尉氏兴国寺塔","width":320,"height":480}}